From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Herman van Hazendonk <github.com@herrie.org>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 16:29:05 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] webOS: vote on polls from the app

Votes from the app arrive through "webos-im-send-poll-vote" (account,
chat, poll id, the full selection separated by 0x1f) and are sent with
BuildPollVote(). That needs the poll's original sender exactly as
whatsmeow stored its message secret, and FromMe and IsGroup, so the
message cache now records the raw sender, FromMe and IsGroup.

When the poll is no longer cached, the sender the transport stashes as
"webos-pollvote-sender" is used, trying both its phone-number and LID
forms against the message secret store.

Signed-off-by: Herman van Hazendonk <github.com@herrie.org>
Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [webOS specific]
